{"id":"e145640be927aa76","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-l.md","title":"Deterministic Logarithmic Space","display":"df-l — Deterministic Logarithmic Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-dspace]]"],"display":"df-l — Deterministic Logarithmic Space","label":"28-df-l","aliases":["28-df-l"],"type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4382c6bdd7033833\" href=\"?note=4382c6bdd7033833\" title=\"28-df-dspace\">28-df-dspace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-l — Deterministic Logarithmic Space"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-l"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-l</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE}(s)\">\\(\\mathrm{DSPACE}(s)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4382c6bdd7033833\" href=\"?note=4382c6bdd7033833\" title=\"28-df-dspace\">28-df-dspace</a>，仅计工作带且允许常数因子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\\coloneqq\\mathrm{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf L\\coloneqq\\mathrm{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对数界加上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> 避免空输入的零空间问题；输入带只读且不计入空间，这使小于输入长度的空间界有意义。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义4.5；印刷81页；PDF107页。陈述已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-dspace","status":"resolved","id":"4382c6bdd7033833","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-dspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-dspace","status":"resolved","id":"4382c6bdd7033833","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DSPACE}(s)$ 见 [[28-df-dspace]]，仅计工作带且允许常数因子。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{DSPACE}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf L\\coloneqq\\mathrm{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil).","display":true},{"tex":"2","display":false}],"bytes":713,"backlinks":[{"id":"c36828ce471a79d1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a91903f455f49892","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ 见 [[28-df-l]]；对每个候选全函数 $f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*$，以下定义参数族 $B_f,D_f$；输出比特以 $1$ 为起始索引。"},{"id":"eaa0de797e94fa6b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ 见 [[28-df-l]]；$G:\\{1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*$；字符串下标从一开始，$\\operatorname{bin}(i)$ 为正整数标准二进制编码。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"基本复杂性类：[[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-np]]、[[28-df-conp]]、[[28-df-l]]、[[28-df-nl]]、[[28-df-pspace]]、[[28-df-npspace]]、[[28-df-exp]]、[[28-df-nexp]]。"},{"id":"56dcd157465c8761","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05f4c5c9288daa5c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{UPATH}$ 见 [[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]；$\\mathbf L$ 为只计工作带空间的确定型对数空间类，见 [[28-df-l]]。"},{"id":"e244e427679f34a1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["4382c6bdd7033833"]}